title: Valve Puzzle
story: fever-dream
description: Tests valve left (drain) and right (flood) outcomes

---

## Setup — get to cistern with fungus consumed

$teleport Cistern

## No valve elsewhere

# Valve commands only work on the iron valve
> turn valve left
[OK: not contains "no valve"]

## Left drains successfully

> turn valve left
[OK: contains "drain"]
[EVENT: true, type="story.event.valve-drain"]
[OK: not contains "flood"]

## Cannot drain twice

> turn valve left
[OK: contains "already"]
[EVENT: false, type="story.event.valve-drain"]
